# .aiexclude - Configuration for AI Coding Agents
# This file defines patterns that AI agents should ignore when analyzing the codebase.
# Excluding these helps focus the agent on relevant source code and reduces noise.

# Assets and media (large binary files, not readable as text)
assets/*

# Build outputs and dependency management files
build/*
.dart_tool/*

# Platform-specific project files (Android, iOS, Web, Desktop)
# Usually contains boilerplate and native code not relevant for general Flutter logic.
android/*
ios/*
web/*
windows/*
macos/*
linux/*

# IDE-specific settings (IntelliJ/Android Studio)
.idea/*
